      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "モノローグ",
      "source_fingerprint": "143e706e67b179bcda182d47e6a727910bb5778ac01a05356150554568138628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31e7c8e8c2e59670a1c8b7a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ナリタトップロードの練習を見た恩師は言う。\n誰もが努力し続けられるわけではない。故に、\n彼女は応援され、それを力にできるのだと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d8f80012a23fbe08b2907eb18c810533355e381ecd49c04659f562eeb3e0445",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077402.json",
      "json_path": [
