    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62db48f3441039eb96d26171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新章は魔笛とともに",
      "source_fingerprint": "63019f9e1560f193aaaef1c5bebec62cc0c99b5d70c7d90f06df7c1120455dd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7073a9d74993bb8996a6ed0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『宝塚記念』が迫るもナリタトップロードは\nいまだテイエムオペラオーに届いていない。\n現状を打開するため、再び恩師を訪ねる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e13e0a8733c27cc2bfe7ec4222fc57b6ff367fae3add4bea3a7debc1aa07f55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433cad2f0670d53a76e2829b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "恩師は、テイエムオペラオーの強さを\nヨーロッパのサッカー選手に例えた。\n一辺倒なやり方では、歯が立たない――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0face323c0189eff75a96f8ac5fa852c0e69d5274dd58ecb19c03b3152af95c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077404.json",
