    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a4c4cb94664e1d5713eda9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "視界を広げる――ナリタトップロードと2人、\nサッカーの歴史書を必死に読み漁り、\nそして高め合える友の存在に気づく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "968f81368ff5c948cf313942071c480ec42d03c216ec5a9ed760b02b25fa11f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff4b31014a9c2041d422dc7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "アドマイヤベガは、コースで待っていた。\n1人では進めなかった道も、共に走りを磨き\n合える友人がいるのなら、切り拓ける……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79887c5853b61017ba9357bf2c2ebb78a7a7453dc5a780dbd72986ac08529ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:955142c23751e91a291f5cfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夜中にまで集まってくれたファンにも\n見守られながら……ナリタトップロードは\n星明かりを頼りに、前へと進むのだった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a150e54c53c8cfee721000a12c6cb3d6d4834b1dc178d28a9387b35deb51c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efab7cdda0d6407e4ad321fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挑戦者たちの道",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f94281d482961112646ef89552faa405d34d224a0e12df0dda73fa83e761a82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
