    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8db88fa9ac5ba94df4f55ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金世代に勝利し“道”を示す……各々が\n自身の道を語る中――トレーナーの助言で、\nナリタトップロードは“努力の道”を示す。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7a9cd8dd2bf76765f4fb9e7eccca0bab5f74341eafbec6596b0655b8983cd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077405.json",
      "json_path": [
